# ============================================================================
# Repository .gitignore — restored 2026-09-13 (session 5).
# This file was lost TWICE by GitHub web uploads; its absence is what let a
# real .env be committed (defect D4). It is now tracked, and the CI gate and
# the session-death protocol both assume it exists. Never delete it; if you
# must push by hand, use `git push`, never the web upload.
# ============================================================================

# --- secrets: the one rule that matters -------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.cer
*.crt

# --- python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- local databases, logs, decoded fixtures ---------------------------------
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
decoded/
*.log
logs/
work/logs/

# --- editor / OS --------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Git bundles are a WORKSPACE ARTEFACT, deliberately untracked.
#
# The session-death protocol (rule 6) says to keep a bundle in work/patches/ and
# push it. Committing it does not work: `git bundle create --all` includes every
# committed object, so the bundle contains the PREVIOUS bundle, and the file
# doubles every milestone - 5.7 MB, 11.4 MB, 22.9 MB, 45.8 MB, 91.7 MB - hitting
# GitHub's 100 MB hard limit in about five milestones and permanently bloating
# every clone along the way.
#
# The bundle is still created here at the end of every milestone, and it still
# records a complete history, so it is a valid local safety net for the current
# session. What actually survives a dead sandbox is `git push`, which is why rule
# 1 says to push at every milestone and never use the web upload.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
work/patches/*.bundle
qwe-agen-broker-platform-backend/work/patches/*.bundle
